# Ignore .agents/ but allow specific tracked skills.
# When adding or removing a skill under .agents/skills, update the allowlist
# below to match its exact directory name. Otherwise `git add` warns "paths are
# ignored" — the skill still commits, but the warning is noise. The
# `!.agents/skills/` line re-includes the parent directory so the per-skill
# negations below can take effect.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/memory-bank/
